// frozen position payload + its canonical hash, and the job
// aggregate-set descriptor (§3A.5: ordered job IDs + states +
// per-aggregate definition/occurrence-set digests + set hash
// + count, with an explicit signed empty set for books that
// carry no jobs). Caller input may only MATCH this data,
